#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/from-numpy-to-pytorch.md:43
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"在 {ref}`back-propagation` 中，我们需要计算 $\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial w}$。用 "
"NumPy，你必须手动推导和实现："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/pytorch-practice/from-numpy-to-pytorch.md:45
msgid ""
"# NumPy 实现线性回归的梯度\n"
"# 手动推导：dL/dw = 2 * X^T @ (Xw - y) / n\n"
"def compute_gradient(X, y, w):\n"
"    n = len(y)\n"
"    predictions = X @ w\n"
"    error = predictions - y\n"
"    gradient = 2 * X.T @ error / n  # 手动实现的梯度公式\n"
"    return gradient\n"
msgstr ""

